  "details": "the \"Arabic\" Language in the bio is unreadble, so I recommend either changing it to be in English, or a way to fix the language itself.\n\nIt should be like this: \"العربية\" or \"Arabic\" to make it readable, the letters should link together, but as it is currently in-game \"i t ' s w r i t t e n l i k e t h i s\", so it's very difficult to read and understand.\n\nALSO: it should be written \"Right to Left\", not \"Left to Right\".",
